 KubeCoder's deploy repo: the Helm chart, the app's Terraform and the per-stage configuration
 Argo CD syncs KubeCoder from.
+
+## Copied from HelmCharts
+
+`chart/` and `config/{dev,prd}/values.yaml` are copies of HelmCharts' `charts/kubecoder` and
+`configs/prd/kubecoder/{dev,prd}/values.yaml`, and `chart/files/ca/homelab-root.crt` of its
+`homelab-root.crt`, at HelmCharts commit `65ca9dbea91d5e363817210c57004e2107ef9cf5` — the last to
+touch any of them when they were copied. HelmCharts deploys KubeCoder until the cutover, so what
+landed there since is not here yet:
+
+```
+git -C /work/HelmCharts log 65ca9dbea91d5e363817210c57004e2107ef9cf5..origin/main -- \
+  charts/kubecoder configs/prd/kubecoder homelab-root.crt
+```
